== snap 1
$ echo hi >&0; echo "st $?"
hi
st 0
$ read x <&2; echo "st $? [$x]"
typed
st 0 [typed]
$ exec 3>&0; echo three >&3; echo "st $?"
three
st 0
$
@ 9,2
